00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.440
So in a single class,
I want to give you

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.960
a good overview of all the main
techniques in optimal control

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.600
and learning-based control.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:37.700
Of course, optimal control is
a field that is 50 years old.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:41.560
So there is a very broad
literature, widely used.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.780
And as it pertains to
learning-based control,

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.680
as you probably
know, this is one

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.300
of the hottest topics
in the field of AI,

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.920
so how to control robots with
the learning-based techniques.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.160
So a lot of techniques.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.880
I will try to give you a good
taxonomy of these techniques

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:58.800
and a good understanding of
the main techniques out there,

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.440
but we will be covering
a lot of stuff.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.607
And necessarily, it will
